# Reports Module

> Business intelligence, operational analytics, and executive reporting for mineral acquisition operations.

---

# Overview

The Reports module provides real-time operational insights across every area of Oil & Gas OS.

It consolidates information from Deals, Mailer Lists, Campaigns, Assets, Title Review, Curative, Closing, Payments, and Documents into actionable dashboards and reports.

Reports help acquisition teams monitor performance, identify bottlenecks, forecast revenue, and measure operational efficiency.

---

# Objectives

The Reports module enables users to:

- Monitor acquisition performance
- Analyze campaign effectiveness
- Track deal pipeline health
- Measure closing performance
- Review financial metrics
- Identify operational bottlenecks
- Support executive decision-making
- Export business reports

